  "clause_1_scope": "This standard specifies material, dimensions and other requirements for centrifugal liners and supporting screens for various types of centrifugal machines: a) Supporting screens for centrifugal machines: 1) Batch type, or 2) Continuous type. b) Liners for: 1) Batch type flat bottom centrifugal for high grade Massecuite; 2) Batch type self-discharging type centrifugal for high grade Massecuites; and 3) Continuous type centrifugal for B and C Massecuites.",
